  "details": "I really hate my position in +18 verification of VRChat. I'm Russian and 25. For some reason, system doesn't accept local Russian documents for it. Only traveling (international) passport/driving licence are accepted which I've been struggling to get for years. \n\nSo many instances are +18 locked now, be it public or groups. Several times trying to join friends and being met with that lock. It's unfair enough I can't buy VRC+ due to sanctions, but even after someone gifted me that I couldn't. \n\nJust... why?",
